          "quote": "An admission event identity binds its event kind, payload digest, scope,\noptional occurrence, exact claim, claim judgment, source frontier, owner,\nscope, and basis. The materialized relation identity binds the unchanged claim,\nclaim judgment, event, event judgment, and profile basis.",
          "section_id": "repo://stdo-v3-generation-rc9/codex/5592168e26759f37e730aed12c030a6061709ec4/source/standards/TRAVERSAL_OCCURRENCE_PROFILE.md#The%20%60a_c%60%20Traversal%20Occurrence%20Profile%20over%20Mutable%20Subjects%2FCandidate%2C%20Judgment%2C%20Event%2C%20And%20Relation%20Separation",
