      "key": "materialization_support_chain",
      "statement": "Materialized entity cut is builder artifact, not raw source output. Sources retain operational truth; builder observes/comprehends; cut is canonical object-level truth within world-model layer; projections derive from it. Published artifacts should be versioned and explicitly superseded. source→tracing→assurance→ledger→entity cut is the declared path. Immutable cut selects one bounded identity/boundary over ledger evidence with acceptance basis; it is not mutable source truth or identical to ledger. Every accepted attribute should be recoverable through containing cut, justifying entries, accepting assurance and traced sources. No attribute should lack ledger support, no ledger entry assurance, no assurance traceable source. Geometric selection additionally invokes the referenced overlay construction law.",
